# The build context of the API image (apps/api/Dockerfile, ADR 0079). Everything is left out
# unless listed below, so .env files, git history and local installs never reach an image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/
!apps/api/

**/node_modules
**/tests
**/*.test.ts
**/.env*
apps/api/smoke
